      "content": "That sounds like a very optimistic reading. Given the sensitivity of the summit, I need to know if you're downplaying these risks to avoid causing unnecessary alarm. If we go into this summit thinking everything is \"strategic posturing\" and they actually hit us with a trade violation, the diplomatic fallout will be catastrophic for our ministry. Are you absolutely certain there isn't a more significant threat being masked by these \"internal reviews\"?",
